<title>UK: FEK sets $90 million four-year bond.</title>
<headline>FEK sets $90 million four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers New Japan Securities Europe Ltd and IBJ International Plc.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FINNISH EXPORT CREDIT</p>
<p> AMT    $90 MLN	 COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    17.JUL.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    17.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.15	LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AA    DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
